.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
https://github.com/vallezw/sonner/assets/50796600/59b95cb7-9068-4f3e-8469-0b35d9de5cf0

.PP
\fRSonner\fP is an opinionated toast component for React\&. You can read more about why and how it was built \fRhere\fP\&.
.SS "Usage"
To start using the library, install it in your project:

.PP
.PP
.nf
npm install sonner
.fi
.PP

.PP
Add \fR<Toaster />\fP to your app, it will be the place where all your toasts will be rendered\&. After that you can use \fRtoast()\fP from anywhere in your app\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
import { Toaster, toast } from 'sonner';

// \&.\&.\&.

function App() {
  return (
    <div>
      <Toaster />
      <button onClick={() => toast('My first toast')}>Give me a toast</button>
    </div>
  );
}
.fi
.PP
.SS "Documentation"
Find the full API reference in the \fRdocumentation\fP\&. 
